# Skill eval loop working material — see skills/verdict-workspace/.gitignore
# for the specific rule (only evals/evals.json is tracked, everything else
# there is point-in-time, regenerable working output).

# Transient agent working material — throwaway docs, logs, scripts,
# research notes, anything that stops mattering once it has been read.
# Kept inside .agents/ so every agent writes it to one known place
# instead of a harness-specific temp dir, but untracked because it is
# working material, not part of the repo. Durable notes never land
# here; they go in AGENTS.md / HANDOFF.md / .agents/memory/ / .agents/plans/.
.agents/scratch/

# Harness config: the project-scope, shareable parts are committed
# (they record this repo's toolchain), the personal/machine-local ones
# are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json
